Set $k\leq n-1$. The sets of relations corresponding with the following graphs are not admissible.
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{c c}
\xymatrixrowsep{0.5cm}
\xymatrixcolsep{0.1cm}\xymatrix @C=0.2em {
&\scriptstyle{(k+1,j)}\ar[rd] &

\scriptstyle{(k,j-1)} \ar[ru] & &\scriptstyle{(k,j)}

}

& \xymatrixrowsep{0.5cm}
\xymatrixcolsep{0.1cm}\xymatrix@C=0.2em{
\scriptstyle{(k,j)}\ar[rd] & &\scriptstyle{(k,j+1)}

&\scriptstyle{(k-1,j)}\ar[ru] &

}

(i) & (ii)
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
